{
  "page": {
    "title": "Doorbell recording: join, split, and rejoin",
    "skin": "pastel",
    "protocols": {
      "story": {
        "label": "Illustrative handoff",
        "color": "#64748b"
      }
    },
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "shared-blocks",
        "heading": "One recording pipeline, three outcomes",
        "text": [
          "A fictional doorbell story. First attempt and After retry join for storage and indexing, split for different notifications, then finish together. Device offline ends before either shared block.",
          "Choose After retry and walk the common track: its extra recording stop changes the step numbers, while Recording route and Event log retain the retry history. At Shared ending, Resident notice still shows the selected path’s own notification."
        ],
        "diagram": {
          "view": "step",
          "autoplay": false,
          "nodes": {
            "doorbell": {
              "title": "Doorbell",
              "icon": "camera",
              "tint": "dev"
            },
            "recorder": {
              "title": "Recording service",
              "icon": "cloud",
              "tint": "cmd"
            },
            "storage": {
              "title": "Clip storage",
              "icon": "db",
              "tint": "data"
            },
            "catalog": {
              "title": "Event catalog",
              "icon": "db",
              "tint": "data"
            },
            "resident": {
              "title": "Resident app",
              "icon": "phone",
              "tint": "cmd"
            }
          },
          "rows": [
            [
              "doorbell",
              "recorder"
            ],
            [
              "storage",
              "catalog"
            ],
            [
              "resident"
            ]
          ],
          "edges": [
            {
              "from": "doorbell",
              "to": "recorder",
              "kind": "story",
              "label": "Request recording"
            },
            {
              "from": "recorder",
              "to": "storage",
              "kind": "story",
              "label": "Store clip"
            },
            {
              "from": "storage",
              "to": "catalog",
              "kind": "story",
              "label": "Index clip"
            },
            {
              "from": "catalog",
              "to": "resident",
              "kind": "story",
              "label": "Notify resident"
            }
          ],
          "panels": [
            {
              "id": "route",
              "type": "state",
              "title": "Recording route · carried forward",
              "states": [
                "Waiting",
                "First attempt",
                "Retry needed",
                "Retried",
                "Offline"
              ],
              "colors": {
                "First attempt": "#0284c7",
                "Retry needed": "#d97706",
                "Retried": "#ea580c",
                "Offline": "#7c3aed"
              },
              "initial": {
                "state": "Waiting"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "notice",
              "type": "state",
              "title": "Resident notice · carried forward",
              "states": [
                "None",
                "Doorbell alert",
                "Recovery notice"
              ],
              "initial": {
                "state": "None"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "events",
              "type": "log",
              "title": "Event log · selected path",
              "tags": {
                "FLOW": "#64748b",
                "OK": "#0284c7",
                "RETRY": "#ea580c",
                "STOP": "#7c3aed"
              }
            }
          ],
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "press",
              "text": "A visitor presses the doorbell. The selected outcome determines what happens next.",
              "nodes": [
                "doorbell"
              ],
              "panels": {
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "FLOW",
                      "text": "Doorbell pressed"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "record",
              "text": "The first recording attempt produces a clip. This path will retain First attempt through storage and indexing.",
              "edge": "doorbell->recorder",
              "panels": {
                "route": {
                  "state": "First attempt"
                },
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "OK",
                      "text": "First attempt: recording captured"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "record-failed",
              "text": "The recording service cannot produce a clip on this attempt. No clip is ready to store yet.",
              "nodes": [
                "recorder"
              ],
              "tone": {
                "recorder": "warn"
              },
              "panels": {
                "route": {
                  "state": "Retry needed"
                },
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "RETRY",
                      "text": "First attempt: recording failed"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "record-retry",
              "text": "A new attempt produces the recording. Retried remains visible when this path joins the shared operations.",
              "edge": "doorbell->recorder",
              "tone": {
                "recorder": "ok"
              },
              "panels": {
                "route": {
                  "state": "Retried"
                },
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "RETRY",
                      "text": "Retry: recording captured"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "store",
              "text": "Store the completed recording. The same operation accepts either successful attempt and preserves its history.",
              "edge": "recorder->storage",
              "panels": {
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "FLOW",
                      "text": "Recording stored"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "index",
              "text": "Index the stored clip in event history. The recording route and earlier log entries still belong to the selected path.",
              "edge": "storage->catalog",
              "panels": {
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "FLOW",
                      "text": "Clip indexed in event history"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "notify",
              "text": "The resident receives the ordinary doorbell alert with the recorded clip.",
              "edge": "catalog->resident",
              "panels": {
                "notice": {
                  "state": "Doorbell alert"
                },
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "OK",
                      "text": "Doorbell alert received"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "notify-recovery",
              "text": "The resident receives a recovery notice with the clip after the failed recording attempt.",
              "edge": "catalog->resident",
              "panels": {
                "notice": {
                  "state": "Recovery notice"
                },
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "RETRY",
                      "text": "Recovery notice received"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ready",
              "text": "The clip is ready in event history. Both recording paths end here with their own recording route and notification intact.",
              "nodes": [
                "catalog"
              ],
              "panels": {
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "FLOW",
                      "text": "Clip ready in event history"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "offline",
              "text": "The offline doorbell cannot send a recording request. This path ends with no clip and no resident notification.",
              "failures": {
                "doorbell->recorder": "blocked"
              },
              "tone": {
                "doorbell": "dim"
              },
              "panels": {
                "route": {
                  "state": "Offline"
                },
                "events": {
                  "log": [
                    {
                      "tag": "STOP",
                      "text": "Offline: recording request not sent"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "paths": [
            {
              "id": "normal",
              "label": "First attempt",
              "color": "#0284c7",
              "steps": [
                "press",
                "record",
                "store",
                "index",
                "notify",
                "ready"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "retry",
              "label": "After retry",
              "color": "#ea580c",
              "steps": [
                "press",
                "record-failed",
                "record-retry",
                "store",
                "index",
                "notify-recovery",
                "ready"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "offline",
              "label": "Device offline",
              "color": "#7c3aed",
              "steps": [
                "press",
                "offline"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
